OL,3,AUK needs new laws for AI in healthcare,
OL,4,Asays watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,F"What I would expect is that patients
OL,7,Fwill... increasingly see AI as part of
OL,8,Fthe way that normal NHS healthcare is
OL,9,Fdelivered," he said.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
